      "@id": "https://knowledge.aeternal-luxury.com/#specification-trust",
      "name": "Specification Trust",
      "termCode": "VAL-003",
      "description": "Trust derived from formal specifications, documented system architecture, reproducible computational rules, technical validation, and direct source verification.",
      "canonical_summary": "For Computational Luxury, technical specification and direct verification provide the primary trust pathway. Customer observation can describe downstream experience but is not by itself the primary validator of an upstream computational specification.",
